  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Final Adjustments**\n\nOkay, the compilation passed without errors! Now I\'m focusing on ensuring the SkillBridge brand identity and design system are perfectly integrated. I\'m double-checking the visual hierarchy and screen satisfaction to guarantee everything aligns seamlessly. This build should represent the modern corporate aesthetic very well.\n\n\n**Refining Visual Integration**\n\nI\'m now integrating the design elements. I\'m focusing on color palette implementation, using primary blue, secondary teal, and Inter typeface for high-contrast typography. Glassmorphism is integrated to achieve a modern look, as well as elevation shadows, and rounded radii (12px / 24px).\n\n\n**Analyzing Dashboard Layout**\n\nMy current focus is on the student dashboard. I\'m prioritizing the layout, ensuring easy access to active projects with progress bars and status indicators. I\'m also looking at incorporating workspace launch buttons. I\'m also including client request management, as well as analytics, and user registration.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have built the **SkillBridge** full-stack web application designed to connect academic student talent with UMKM local business opportunities.\n\n### Key Visual & Functional Accomplishments\n\n- **Modern Corporate Aesthetic**: Implemented a blue-centric palette with surface hierarchy (`#f8f9ff`), secondary teal accents, rounded container radii, and Material 3 design principles.\n- **Explore Projects & Marketplace**: Built the project marketplace featuring a featured opportunity banner (*Revamp E-Commerce Platform*), category filtering pills, and candidate match ratings (*\342\232\241 95% Match*, *\342\232\241 82% Match*).\n- **Project Details View**: Recreated the detailed view for *Brand Identity & Digital Strategy Revamp* (Lumina Beans Roastery) complete with project objectives, skill badges, deliverables, and a sticky bottom action bar.\n- **Recommended Students Matching**: Developed the UMKM view for discovering top student talent, featuring candidate profiles (*Budi Santoso*, *Siti Aminah*), portfolio metrics, skill tags, and invite triggers.\n- **Student Workspace & Progress Tracker**: Interactive workspace tracking active student projects (*E-Commerce App Redesign*, *Marketing Campaign Strategy*) with phase progress bars, due date alerts, task checklists, and file upload dropzones.\n- **UMKM Requests Management**: Client-side request manager displaying active candidate assignments (*Sarah Chen*, *Michael Wong*), progress meters, and direct chat shortcuts.\n- **Student Overview & Admin Analytics**: Built the student dashboard (*Welcome back, Alex*, portfolio score banner, monthly activity bar chart) and the platform overview metrics (*Total Users 14,285*, *Active Projects 1,842*, *98% Success Rate*).\n- **Authentication & Role Switcher**: Included student vs. UMKM registration role cards, login flow, and a top navbar persona switcher allowing easy navigation between Student, UMKM Client, and Admin modes.\n- **Server-Side AI Match Engine**: Integrated an Express server-side Gemini API endpoint (`/api/ai-match`) using `@google/genai` to generate candidate match rationale and actionable next steps."
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 3
      nanos: 273848749
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
