  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the App\'s Structure**\n\nI\'m digging into the SkillBridge application, focusing on its architecture. It\'s a student-UMKM micro-internship marketplace. I\'ve identified the core screens: landing (hero), and the project market for browsing/filtering micro-internships. I\'m noting the absence of custom images in `/assets`.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I would be happy to add the new page to your **SkillBridge** platform! \n\nCould you please share the design, screenshot, or description of the page you\'d like to include? \n\n### Current Pages Built in Your App:\n- **Project Marketplace** (`market`): Browse micro-internship opportunities with filters & AI match scores.\n- **Project Details** (`project-details`): Objectives, deliverables, stipend, and one-click application pitch modal.\n- **Student Talent Directory** (`students`): Recommended student candidates with skill badges & match indicators.\n- **Student Workspace** (`my-projects`): Active project tracking, milestone checklists, and submission drawer.\n- **UMKM Client Portal** (`my-requests`): Manage posted requests, assign students, and launch new project requests.\n- **Student Dashboard** (`student-dashboard`): Career stats, portfolio score, and quick access.\n- **Admin Overview** (`admin-overview`): Platform analytics, verification queue, and user management.\n- **Auth Flow** (`login` / `register`): Login and registration screens for Students & UMKMs.\n\n---\n\n### Potential New Page Ideas (if you\'d like suggestions):\n1. **Public UMKM Company Profile Page**\n2. **Student Portfolio Showcase & Verification Page**\n3. **Completion Certificate & Skill Badge Issuer**\n4. **Dedicated Messaging & Direct Contract Hub**\n5. **AI Proposal & Milestone Reviewer**\n\nPlease upload an image, describe the layout, or let me know which concept you\'d like to implement!"
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 871416304
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
