  planner_response {
    modified_response: "I have integrated the new pages and sub-screens into the SkillBridge web application:\n\n- **Settings Hub (`settings`)**:\n  - **Account & Security**: Integrated navigation blocks for **Edit Profile**, **Security & 2FA**, and **Password Change**.\n  - **Preferences**: Added interactive toggles for notifications, appearance (light/dark mode), and system language selection.\n  - **Support & Danger Zone**: Quick access to Help Center, About, Privacy, and Account Sign Out.\n\n- **Edit Profile (`edit-profile`)**:\n  - **Profile Avatar**: Upload and remove avatar functionality with hover camera overlay.\n  - **Personal Information**: Editable fields for first name, last name, professional headline, and bio with live character count (0/500).\n  - **Skills Management**: Interactive skills tag system allowing users to add new skill chips or remove existing ones.\n\n- **Change Password (`change-password`)**:\n  - **Security Form**: Current password, new password, and confirm password fields with visibility toggles.\n  - **Dynamic Strength Meter**: Live calculation displaying Weak, Medium, or Strong status with color-coded strength bar indicators.\n\n- **Help Center Hub (`help-center`)**:\n  - **Search Hero**: High-contrast dark gradient hero section with an instant knowledge base search bar.\n  - **Bento Category Grid**: Interactive tiles for FAQ, Documentation, Contact Support, Report a Problem, and Feedback.\n  - **FAQ Accordion**: Expandable common questions and answers for quick self-service support.\n\n- **Global Search (`global-search`)**:\n  - **Search Interface**: Hero query bar with active category filter chips (**All Categories**, **Students**, **UMKM Projects**).\n  - **Discovery Column**: Recent search history with clear functionality and trending skill tags.\n  - **Bento Suggestions**: Featured project cards, top student candidates with ratings, and category highlights.\n\n- **Project Rating & Review (`rate-project`)**:\n  - **Feedback Form**: Interactive 5-star rating controls for overall project experience as well as category ratings (Communication, Technical Skill, Timeliness) and written review text.\n\n- **Feedback & State Views**:\n  - **Success State (`success-state`)**: Centered success card featuring an animated checkmark graphic and direct action triggers.\n  - **Error State (`error-state`)**: 404/Connection lost screen with retry and back navigation.\n  - **Forgot Password (`forgot-password`)**: Clean password recovery flow with email verification link confirmation.\n  - **Empty Projects State (`empty-projects`)**: Visually engaging empty state encouraging students to browse the marketplace or update their portfolio."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
